#: 159897ba68e84a479b98124c83997659
msgid "You can start SITL at a specific GPS location using the ``-l`` option during launch. See \"Setting vehicle start location\" in :ref:`using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.rst:309
#: b1f84b7013ad4790a3342f51482b7f2a
msgid "If you wish to use a specific set of default parameters, rather than manually changing them in the simulation with ``param set`` commands, you can load them at simulation startup from a file. See :ref:`SITL_simulation_parameters` section \"Loading a parameter set\"."
msgstr ""
